  "about": "The evangelium of the formulary “Saint Lawrence, Martyr” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "At that time, Jesus said to His disciples, Amen, amen, I say to you, unless the grain of wheat falls into the ground and dies, it remains alone. But if it dies, it brings forth much fruit. He who loves his life, loses it; and he who hates his life in this world, keeps it unto life everlasting. If anyone serves Me, let him follow Me; and where I am there also shall My servant be. If anyone serves me, My Father will honor him." }
